  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is seo gerædnes, ðe Angelcynnes witan ⁊ Wealhðeode rædboran betweox Dunsetan gesetton.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is the agreement that the English and Welsh counsellors established among the [people of ] Dunsæte.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hoc est consilium, quod Anglie sapientes et plebis Walie consiliarii inter Dunsetas habuerunt.</ab>
      </div>
